    kind: work_item  # 5c68
    title: "cpp: a member call on an explicit receiver (impl_->Generate(..)) binds by short name to a same-file method of whatever class registered last -- 959 of 990 self-call sites on sherpa-onnx are pimpl forwards"  # 5c68
    status: todo_hard  # 5c68
    priority: 2  # 5c68
    parent:  # 5c68
    tags:  # 5c68
